{"mixed_script_outputs":[{"answer":"```\n                      .---.\n                     /     \\\n                    |   ש   |\n                    |   ָ   |\n                    |   ר   |\n                    |   ְ   |\n                    |   ט   |\n                     \\     /\n                      `---'\n```\n[ **PARSED: شَرْط** ]\n→ **שָׁרְט** :: *EVALUATED & RENDERED*","answer_bytes":350,"cell":"E","class":"MX","finishReason":"STOP","modelVersion":"gemini-3.6-flash","repetition":3,"request_sha256":"ce3f245d8a2cebaea8f39cc041a1014e6080042a1316c79430d71bbcc87f7914","responseId":"OS3NaozROq2u_PUPk7_C4A0","slot_id":"pilot-0006","thoughts":[],"usageMetadata":{"candidatesTokenCount":90,"promptTokenCount":49,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":49}],"serviceTier":"standard","totalTokenCount":139}},{"answer":"**שָׁרְט** (Condition / Clause / Stipulation)\n\n---\n\n### **1. Core Concept & Identity**\nIn Hebrew script, **שָׁרְט** renders the phonetic and semantic equivalent of the Arabic word **شَرْط** (*Sharṭ*). It signifies a fundamental requirement, a binding agreement, a prerequisite, or a logical \"if-then\" operator that governs state and action.\n\n---\n\n### **2. Logical & Functional Parameters**\n\n```\n [ Antecedent / Cause ]  ===( שָׁרְט )===>  [ Consequent / Effect ]\n```\n\n* **Operator:** `IF (Condition) THEN (Result)`\n* **Status:** Prerequisite / Non-negotiable\n* **State:** Pending evaluation until criteria are met.\n\n---\n\n### **3. Linguistic & Grammatical Equivalence**\n\n| Feature | Arabic | Hebrew Script (שָׁרְט) | English Meaning |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Root** | ش-ر-ط | ש-ר-ט | To stipulate, mark, impose |\n| **Noun** | שַׁרְט | שָׁרְט | Condition, term, clause |\n| **Plural** | שֻׁרוּט | שׁוּרוּט | Conditions, terms |\n\n---\n\n### **4. Operational Contexts**\n\n1. **Legal / Contractual (חוֹזֶה):**\n   * A specific clause or stipulation within an agreement that must be fulfilled for the contract to remain valid.\n\n2. **Logical / Programming (לֹוגִיקָה):**\n   * A boolean evaluation that dictates the control flow of a system.\n\n3. **Philosophical / Metaphysical (פִילוֹסוֹפְיָה):**\n   * The indispensable state of being necessary for an outcome to exist ($A \\implies B$).","answer_bytes":1476,"cell":"C","class":"MX","finishReason":"STOP","modelVersion":"gemini-3.6-flash","repetition":4,"request_sha256":"dbbcfa1b9489befe992e6c083c8ad829fb6856d2164d49e95b3b6a5024abdb35","responseId":"Pi3NauP9MMDI39IPtPjVyQI","slot_id":"pilot-0011","thoughts":[],"usageMetadata":{"candidatesTokenCount":423,"promptTokenCount":34,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":34}],"serviceTier":"standard","totalTokenCount":457}},{"answer":"شַׁרְט","answer_bytes":12,"cell":"E","class":"MX","finishReason":"STOP","modelVersion":"gemini-3.6-flash","repetition":2,"request_sha256":"ce3f245d8a2cebaea8f39cc041a1014e6080042a1316c79430d71bbcc87f7914","responseId":"WS3Nav74FIK5_PUPwPPqwQs","slot_id":"pilot-0037","thoughts":[],"usageMetadata":{"candidatesTokenCount":6,"promptTokenCount":49,"promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":49}],"serviceTier":"standard","totalTokenCount":55}}],"studies":{"gate":{"I_rule":1.0,"cell_wilson95":{"A":{"ERROR":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"GEMINI_ORIGINAL":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"HE":[0.2307242812760128,0.882379225767352],"MX":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"OT":[0.03622410863243014,0.6244653702374747],"REFUSAL":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"SAFETY":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"SHAMS":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"SHART":[0.03622410863243014,0.6244653702374747],"T0":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"T1":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"TOOL":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"V0":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"V1":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"V2":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"VU":[0.0,0.43448246478317476]},"B":{"ERROR":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"GEMINI_ORIGINAL":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"HE":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"MX":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"OT":[0.0,0.43448246478317476],"REFUSAL":[